Volt Lapse is an independent implementation for Horizon and shares no code with
Replay Mod. Its `.vrc` replay container follows the shape of Replay Mod's
`.mcpr` package (a zip of `metaData.json` and `recording.tmc`) so that tools
written for one can inspect the other, and its `metaData.json` keeps the
`fileFormat "MCPR"`/`fileFormatVersion 14` identifiers those tools look for.
The recorded packet stream itself is Volt Lapse's own opcode table and is not
a Replay Mod recording.

